WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.596
It all starts with a report.

00:00:02.596 --> 00:00:06.963
AlejoSeguro turns every phone in the territory into a security sensor.

00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:15.950
On top of that collection, facial and license plate recognition joins the video surveillance cameras your institution already has on the street.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:17.718
And what if there is no data or smartphone?

00:00:17.718 --> 00:00:22.716
CatheAsiste answers the call and turns voice into the same structured data.

00:00:22.716 --> 00:00:24.312
It also works offline.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.721
Documents, images, audio and video.

00:00:28.721 --> 00:00:33.870
Everything feeds the other three lines of the ecosystem, and from here the data passes to analysis.
